  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: Ta
    Lines:
    - "Sau khi c\u1EAFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ti\u1EBFp t\u1EBF c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n Ki\u1EC3u.
      Ch\u1ECDn ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1EE3i, ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1EBFn khi qu\xE2n Ki\u1EC1u
      y\u1EBFu th\xEA s\u1EBD l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng. Nh\u01B0ng ..."
    - "Ng\xE0y th\u1EE9 s\xE1u. Ch\xE1o lo\xE3ng. Kho g\u1EA1o tr\u01A1 \u0111\xE1y.
      G\xE1c m\u1EC7t, v\xF2ng si\u1EBFt h\u1EDF mi\u1EC7ng."
    - "Ki\u1EC1u \u0111\xE1nh hai c\u1ED5ng. B\u1EBFn s\xF4ng b\u1ECB nh\u1ED5 c\u1ECDc.
      Thuy\u1EC1n l\u01B0\u01A1ng v\xE0o th\xE0nh li\xEAn ti\u1EBFp. Tu\u1EA7n tra
      \u0110inh b\u1ECB k\u1EB9p gi\u1EEFa m\xE9p n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0 b\xE3i s\u1ECFi.
      L\xEDnh ng\xE3 v\xEC \u0111\xF3i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi v\xEC \u0111ao."
